# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit real keys.
# The app talks to the hosted ASCENT-Backend by default. To develop against a
# local backend (port 5000), uncomment and use your computer's LAN IP:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.10:5000
#
# Meal photo AI now runs on the backend: put GEMINI_API_KEY in ASCENT-Backend's
# .env (local) or the Render service's Environment (hosted), not here.
